WEBVTT

00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:16.884
Holding you and kissing you enough to bask in

00:00:16.884 --> 00:00:23.090
Fighting and loving each other enough to bask in

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:29.296
I want to know you, just as you are

00:00:29.296 --> 00:00:35.035
But I'm the one who can't just be myself

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:38.171
I don't understand

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.908
Your heart

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:42.910
Why is it?

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:47.548
Are you really a sorceress then?

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:51.718
I want to hold you

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:55.322
Alone, I cry

00:00:55.322 --> 00:00:59.993
I don't ever want to be alone again

00:01:01.328 --> 00:01:04.331
I want to hold you

00:01:04.331 --> 00:01:07.634
With you, I fly

00:01:08.035 --> 00:01:15.409
I melt into the emotional voice
that almost seems to be crying

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:21.915
Serenade

00:01:43.003 --> 00:01:44.438
Not yet...

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:47.808
| can't go yet.

00:01:47.808 --> 00:01:51.378
| still have things I must do.

00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:54.114
Things I must tell...

00:01:56.083 --> 00:01:57.417
Don't keep standing there.

00:01:57.417 --> 00:02:00.654
Why don't you just come in?

00:02:04.625 --> 00:02:10.697
The secret h1iooeEn
I my SsWoORrRO

00:02:19.373 --> 00:02:22.409
Hey, wait a minute, please, Master!

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:25.045
What are you saying?

00:02:25.045 --> 00:02:29.116
After we cross this hill, we're in the
Valley of Yuginia, where Rocks Row is!

00:02:29.116 --> 00:02:33.153
We'll finally find out how to save Azalie.

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:36.657
We can't sit here and rot in a place like this.

00:02:36.657 --> 00:02:37.658
Right?

00:02:37.658 --> 00:02:38.525
Yeah.

00:02:38.859 --> 00:02:44.731
| know. But they're heavy,
and they're glaring at me too.

00:02:46.767 --> 00:02:50.804
So, why are we bringing these things anyway?

00:02:50.804 --> 00:02:53.106
It's a gift, of course!

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:57.144
This Row person lives deep
in the mountains.

00:02:57.144 --> 00:03:00.480
He'll rarely have bounty
from the sea to eat, right?

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.649
There's no doubt he'll be happy!

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:08.822
Then he'll give us the info on the
Sword of Baltanders wholeheartedly.

00:03:08.822 --> 00:03:12.659
But I think bringing this many
is an inconvenience.

00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:14.294
Did you say something?

00:03:14.294 --> 00:03:20.100
No... But I'd be grateful if someone
carried some of this stuff a bit.

00:03:21.735 --> 00:03:25.505
No way! Isn't this part of your training?

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:28.208
We're almost there?

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:29.042
Yes.

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:32.813
But I wonder what kind of person this Row is?

00:03:32.813 --> 00:03:34.514
An eccentric old man.

00:03:34.514 --> 00:03:36.216
What? You know him?

00:03:36.216 --> 00:03:39.386
He's the sorcerer that was Childman's Master.

00:03:39.753 --> 00:03:42.055
I met him just once a long time ago.

00:03:51.598 --> 00:03:54.501
He got disgusted with the
Tower of Fangs and took off.

00:03:54.501 --> 00:03:55.802
He's just a weirdo.

00:03:55.802 --> 00:03:57.404
A weirdo?

00:03:57.404 --> 00:04:00.240
Why is carrying baggage training?

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:04.444
After all, why is it me all the time?

00:04:05.879 --> 00:04:08.081
Oh, no! I wasn't really complaining, or...

00:04:09.816 --> 00:04:11.084
We're going!

00:04:15.789 --> 00:04:20.193
All sorts of things have happened,
so maybe I've grown up a little.

00:04:20.894 --> 00:04:24.631
Yes, everything began at that moment.

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:35.842
From the moment I met Orphen, everything.

00:04:44.451 --> 00:04:47.287
And then Bloody August...

00:04:55.829 --> 00:04:57.030
That is...

00:04:57.030 --> 00:05:00.433
What could... Bloody August has come!

00:05:06.907 --> 00:05:09.009
I've waited a year for you!

00:05:09.009 --> 00:05:14.514
No, for the five years since I left
the Tower, I've searched for you.

00:05:14.881 --> 00:05:16.049
Azalie!

00:05:16.817 --> 00:05:18.185
Azalie?

00:05:18.552 --> 00:05:20.253
Is that a woman's name?

00:05:20.253 --> 00:05:22.422
Azalie, it's me! Do you understand?

00:05:24.191 --> 00:05:28.395
The sword of Baltanders is right here,
but I can't give it to you.

00:05:29.763 --> 00:05:31.932
This won't save you!

00:05:32.399 --> 00:05:35.302
So please sleep for a while.

00:05:39.439 --> 00:05:41.474
Spin around me, Armour of Ice!

00:05:44.845 --> 00:05:47.147
Bring peace, Sleep of Atonement!

00:05:58.692 --> 00:05:59.693
This is...

00:06:06.099 --> 00:06:08.001
Azalie, don't go!

00:06:10.937 --> 00:06:12.439
Please don't go!

00:06:14.741 --> 00:06:16.977
But the binding failed,

00:06:16.977 --> 00:06:20.046
and Bloody August,
who couldn't steal the sword,

00:06:20.046 --> 00:06:21.715
came for my big sister and me.

00:06:33.994 --> 00:06:35.795
Big Sister, hurry!

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:01.821
It's coming.

00:07:11.097 --> 00:07:12.933
So, you want this?

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:14.901
Azalie!

00:07:25.578 --> 00:07:28.248
Bring peace, Sleep of Atonement!

00:07:51.905 --> 00:07:54.407
Whom did you say you've bound?

00:07:57.544 --> 00:07:58.411
O Light!

00:08:26.406 --> 00:08:27.674
Azalie!

00:08:29.642 --> 00:08:31.044
You understand now, don't you?

00:08:31.044 --> 00:08:35.715
The power buried in the sword
can't yet be controlled by you or me!

00:08:36.516 --> 00:08:39.886
That sword can't return you to your true form!

00:08:42.522 --> 00:08:43.957
Wait, Azalie!

00:08:53.033 --> 00:08:58.238
That was when I first realized
the power of the Sword of Baltanders,

00:08:58.238 --> 00:09:02.876
and the fact that Miss Azalie
was Bloody August.

00:09:05.445 --> 00:09:08.681
That was just before I met you.

00:09:11.451 --> 00:09:14.687
It's been a while.
Has it been ten years already?

00:09:15.121 --> 00:09:17.390
You seem well. That is good, Rocks Row.

00:09:17.791 --> 00:09:20.827
So you've learned to flatter
like a grown up, have you?

00:09:21.528 --> 00:09:23.496
Time changes people.

00:09:23.496 --> 00:09:26.132
And so, the reason I've grown old.

00:09:26.866 --> 00:09:30.737
Today, I have something
| would like to discuss with you.

00:09:31.271 --> 00:09:33.273
Is it about Azalie?

00:09:34.107 --> 00:09:35.608
So, you know of that?

00:09:36.142 --> 00:09:38.578
Who do you think I am?

00:09:39.779 --> 00:09:42.582
Even though I don't have contact
with the everyday world,

00:09:42.582 --> 00:09:45.185
there is nothing that escapes my eyes.

00:09:45.185 --> 00:09:46.219
Just as is expected.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:49.489
Then, with that power of yours, find Azalie,

00:09:49.489 --> 00:09:52.092
no, Bloody August, please.

00:09:53.226 --> 00:09:56.262
| don't want her to suffer any longer.

00:09:56.863 --> 00:10:00.366
Then by the hand of he who was her master...

00:10:02.802 --> 00:10:05.405
Fine then, Missy.

00:10:09.909 --> 00:10:13.046
When did you realize?

00:10:14.948 --> 00:10:18.918
Well, to say the least,
it wasn't just now, was it?

00:10:19.319 --> 00:10:21.721
Just as expected of a master sorcerer,

00:10:21.721 --> 00:10:24.958
the ultimate prophet, Rocks Row.

00:10:24.958 --> 00:10:30.029
So, then what am I to do at the Tower of Fangs?

00:10:31.297 --> 00:10:34.467
| have a pretty good idea what that will be.

00:10:35.368 --> 00:10:38.037
A terrifying person, after all.

00:10:59.559 --> 00:11:01.961
So this is the Valley of Yuginia!

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:06.799
Say, where is Row's house?

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:12.305
All that's written in this book is
Rocks Row of the Valley of Yuginia.

00:11:12.305 --> 00:11:14.707
There's nothing else written.

00:11:14.707 --> 00:11:16.442
Really! Hand it over!

00:11:17.377 --> 00:11:20.013
Did you really look at it right?

00:11:27.587 --> 00:11:32.091
"Baltanders, meaning eternal yet ephemeral."

00:11:32.926 --> 00:11:36.396
Everything happened in front of
the ruins with that name.

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:39.132
Hey, show me that sword too.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.669
What a magnificent sword.

00:11:42.669 --> 00:11:45.271
Something like "The Sword of Baltanders."

00:11:45.572 --> 00:11:48.508
What kinds of magics are hidden within?

00:11:48.808 --> 00:11:51.578
You can read it, Azalie? What does it mean?

00:11:51.578 --> 00:11:53.913
Even I don't know that.

00:11:53.913 --> 00:11:57.217
Well for now, let's test it to see its effects.

00:12:28.181 --> 00:12:29.549
That can't be!

00:12:29.549 --> 00:12:33.820
Amazing, this is the power hidden in the sword.

00:12:34.487 --> 00:12:36.656
Azalie was obsessed with the sword,

00:12:36.656 --> 00:12:41.928
but the Sword of Baltanders was
not meant to be held by her hand.

00:12:46.899 --> 00:12:49.569
Azalie! What's wrong, Azalie?

00:12:50.103 --> 00:12:51.404
Don't come in!

00:12:52.572 --> 00:12:54.907
Please, don't come in.

00:12:55.608 --> 00:12:57.877
Don't come in, Krylancelo!

00:12:58.611 --> 00:13:01.214
That's the Sword of Baltanders.

00:13:02.348 --> 00:13:07.186
Y-you didn't try to test the magic of the sword
on your own body, did you?!

00:13:19.032 --> 00:13:20.533
Krylancelo...

00:13:53.199 --> 00:13:54.801
Cleao...

00:13:56.069 --> 00:13:58.638
what are you doing? We're going!

00:13:58.638 --> 00:14:00.907
How mean! Wait up!

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:10.216
So this is Rocks Row's house.

00:14:13.286 --> 00:14:14.220
Row!

00:14:16.389 --> 00:14:18.524
It looks like no one's here, doesn't it?

00:14:18.725 --> 00:14:19.592
Row!

00:14:19.926 --> 00:14:21.260
Rocks Row!

00:14:22.428 --> 00:14:24.097
I'm coming in!

00:14:26.599 --> 00:14:28.468
It looks like he had visitors.

00:14:28.768 --> 00:14:30.870
He didn't have the lock on.

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:32.972
He'll probably be back soon.

00:14:38.678 --> 00:14:41.247
Is it all right for you to look through
things without permission?

00:14:41.247 --> 00:14:43.449
Sorry, but I don't have time.

00:14:43.449 --> 00:14:45.184
I'll just have to search without him.

00:14:45.718 --> 00:14:50.890
There's got to be data on the
Sword of Baltanders here somewhere.

00:14:59.599 --> 00:15:00.867
Wow!

00:15:01.033 --> 00:15:04.137
This is a textbook on sorcery!

00:15:04.904 --> 00:15:07.407
Then all of these are...

00:15:08.007 --> 00:15:10.777
There should be books useful to you too.

00:15:10.777 --> 00:15:14.847
Row wrote almost all the textbooks
at the Tower of Fangs.

00:15:16.015 --> 00:15:19.018
Oh, Leki! No, you can't just eat that!

00:15:19.018 --> 00:15:20.420
What are you doing?

00:15:21.287 --> 00:15:23.623
Well, nothing.

00:15:25.324 --> 00:15:28.127
It wasn't me! It's Leki! Leki!

00:15:28.127 --> 00:15:29.529
You know, you guys...

00:15:30.329 --> 00:15:32.765
Is your wish to appear as Childman,

00:15:32.765 --> 00:15:35.435
kill the man who became the monster,

00:15:35.435 --> 00:15:40.706
and control experimentation
at the Tower of Fangs, Missy?

00:15:41.307 --> 00:15:43.376
| have no grudge against you.

00:15:43.376 --> 00:15:47.246
In fact as a Master Sorcerer,
| even look up to you.

00:15:47.246 --> 00:15:50.516
But this old man's in the way, right?

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:52.752
You're too dangerous.

00:15:52.752 --> 00:15:56.055
That power of yours makes me afraid.

00:15:56.689 --> 00:15:58.991
<i>So? Are you going to kill me?</i>

00:15:59.459 --> 00:16:01.127
I won't kill you.

00:16:01.127 --> 00:16:04.096
I'll just have you sleep for a while.

00:16:04.664 --> 00:16:07.200
Those eyes drenched in anger.

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:09.869
What changed you so much, Missy?

00:16:10.169 --> 00:16:12.238
What would you understand?!

00:16:13.573 --> 00:16:16.776
Wheel of Light, protect thou my flesh!

00:16:19.145 --> 00:16:21.147
O Daggered Thunder!

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:25.551
What was that sound just now?

00:16:29.288 --> 00:16:30.857
That was...

00:16:32.859 --> 00:16:34.360
It's no use.

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:37.930
You can't defeat me with Childman's strength.

00:16:39.232 --> 00:16:45.338
And your skill is still nowhere
near Childman's, Missy!

00:16:46.405 --> 00:16:49.642
It seems it's not possible to bind you.

00:16:52.345 --> 00:16:54.113
O Light of Destruction!

00:16:54.113 --> 00:16:57.216
O Barrier of Light, where I do go...

00:17:01.587 --> 00:17:03.923
At a time like this...

00:17:13.966 --> 00:17:15.234
| see.

00:17:15.234 --> 00:17:20.706
Even without binding,
the flame of your life was going out.

00:17:21.674 --> 00:17:23.075
Wait...

00:17:23.843 --> 00:17:30.950
Do you think Childman didn't ask me
for help in saving you, Missy?

00:17:32.184 --> 00:17:36.722
Do you think he didn't need my experience?

00:17:48.334 --> 00:17:50.937
As long as my voice lasts, to the other side.

00:17:55.274 --> 00:17:57.276
Row, where are you?

00:17:59.045 --> 00:18:00.046
Row!

00:18:01.714 --> 00:18:02.715
Row!

00:18:08.220 --> 00:18:09.322
Row...

00:18:10.289 --> 00:18:12.391
Row, get a hold of yourself!

00:18:12.391 --> 00:18:14.093
Please hold on.

00:18:15.695 --> 00:18:16.696
Row!

00:18:17.563 --> 00:18:19.665
What in the world happened?

00:18:22.101 --> 00:18:23.235
| see.

00:18:23.769 --> 00:18:27.173
You're the little boy from then.

00:18:27.473 --> 00:18:31.477
What is it? I just messed up a spell.

00:18:31.911 --> 00:18:34.680
Please wait. I'll tend to your wounds now.

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:36.716
Heal that which is mine, Spirit of-

00:18:36.716 --> 00:18:38.250
It's no use.

00:18:39.185 --> 00:18:45.291
Regenerative magic won't work on one
already at the end of life.

00:18:45.291 --> 00:18:46.192
Row...

00:18:46.192 --> 00:18:47.793
| know.

00:18:47.793 --> 00:18:53.366
You want to know how to restore the Missy,
Azalie, to her true state, right?

00:18:53.366 --> 00:18:54.367
Yes.

00:18:56.002 --> 00:18:58.838
There is only one way.

00:18:59.438 --> 00:19:03.509
Those changed by the power of
the Sword of Baltanders

00:19:03.509 --> 00:19:06.345
can only be restored by that sword.

00:19:06.345 --> 00:19:10.249
But with my magic now, that sword is...

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:14.220
Don't put on such a pitiful face.

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:16.822
Now there's only you.

00:19:17.423 --> 00:19:22.228
You're the only one who can save Azalie,
and then Childman.

00:19:23.062 --> 00:19:25.331
Listen closely, okay?

00:19:25.331 --> 00:19:30.102
There isn't anyone anywhere
who can control that sword.

00:19:30.102 --> 00:19:33.305
It's not because you aren't good enough.

00:19:33.305 --> 00:19:36.008
It's because it is an incomplete sword.

00:19:36.008 --> 00:19:37.309
Incomplete?!

00:19:37.843 --> 00:19:44.784
Release from the sword's power will
only occur when the sword is whole.

00:19:44.784 --> 00:19:47.987
And only then can its power be controlled.

00:19:49.121 --> 00:19:52.191
So, to do that...

00:19:52.758 --> 00:19:54.660
To do that...

00:20:04.203 --> 00:20:05.371
Row...

00:20:05.604 --> 00:20:08.007
To do that? What is "that"?

00:20:08.007 --> 00:20:10.142
The way to save Azalie?!

00:20:11.911 --> 00:20:14.280
| beg you. Row, tell me!

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:16.482
Row! Row, open your eyes.

00:20:16.482 --> 00:20:18.684
Row! Row, Row!

00:20:19.185 --> 00:20:21.620
| beg of you, Row! What should 1?

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:22.621
What should I do? Row!

00:20:22.621 --> 00:20:23.989
It's no use, Orphen! Row's already...
What should I do? Row!

00:20:23.989 --> 00:20:25.091
It's no use, Orphen! Row's already...

00:20:30.329 --> 00:20:31.731
It can't be.

00:20:33.299 --> 00:20:35.134
To come all this way...

00:20:37.603 --> 00:20:38.771
Row...

00:20:47.413 --> 00:20:50.983
Great sorcerer Rocks Row,

00:20:51.984 --> 00:20:54.386
please sleep peacefully.

00:20:55.187 --> 00:20:58.624
But, Master, what are we going to do now?

00:20:58.624 --> 00:21:00.726
Isn't it obvious?

00:21:00.726 --> 00:21:04.463
We're going to get the Sword of Baltanders
back from Volcan!

00:21:04.463 --> 00:21:06.832
But he said that the sword is incomplete.

00:21:07.199 --> 00:21:08.567
| know.

00:21:08.567 --> 00:21:13.272
That's why we'll go back to the Island of
Baltanders after we get the sword back.

00:21:13.539 --> 00:21:16.075
To the Island of Baltanders?

00:21:16.475 --> 00:21:19.245
Everything started there.

00:21:19.879 --> 00:21:23.883
There has to be a clue to
making the sword whole.

00:21:24.116 --> 00:21:25.484
That's right!

00:21:25.818 --> 00:21:27.453
I'm sure there is!

00:21:27.453 --> 00:21:30.890
"You have to look at everything
in a positive fashion!"

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:33.459
That's what my dad said,
even on his deathbed.

00:21:33.893 --> 00:21:36.295
| guess he died in a really positive fashion.

00:21:36.295 --> 00:21:38.297
Aren't you jealous?

00:21:38.764 --> 00:21:40.032
Well, yeah.

00:21:40.533 --> 00:21:44.036
Well, now that's what we've decided,
let's hurry up and go!

00:21:44.036 --> 00:21:45.204
Hey!

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:55.080
Leki, what are you doing? We're going!

00:22:00.686 --> 00:22:03.189
Now there's only you.

00:22:03.622 --> 00:22:08.227
You're the only one who can save Azalie,
and then Childman.

00:22:16.569 --> 00:22:19.738
Woah! Why is that sorcerer so mad?

00:22:19.738 --> 00:22:22.074
Why is he trying to catch us?

00:22:22.074 --> 00:22:24.143
Big Brother, you did
something again, didn't you?

00:22:24.143 --> 00:22:26.478
That's the gigantic Giga Sequoia!

00:22:26.478 --> 00:22:29.114
You can't Big Brother!
You can't climb that tree!

00:22:29.114 --> 00:22:31.650
To go farther is Hell. To go back is Hell too.

00:22:31.650 --> 00:22:33.652
What should I do?

00:22:34.053 --> 00:22:35.821
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:35.821 --> 00:22:37.890
you two hurry up and return that sworod!
"You Two Hurry Up and Return That Sword!"

00:22:37.890 --> 00:22:40.092
You two hurry up and rReturn that
sword! Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:40.092 --> 00:22:40.826
You two hurry up
and rReturn that sword!

00:22:42.494 --> 00:22:44.029
What should I do?

00:22:44.029 --> 00:22:46.432
I need you to come after me

00:22:46.432 --> 00:22:50.669
Even if I just kept on walking

00:22:52.238 --> 00:22:53.806
What should I do?

00:22:53.806 --> 00:22:56.242
We wouldn't be able to meet

00:22:56.242 --> 00:23:00.546
Even if we knew each other's cell phone numbers

00:23:01.113 --> 00:23:05.985
Headlights illuminate me

00:23:05.985 --> 00:23:10.289
They're too bright, so I close my eyes

00:23:10.923 --> 00:23:13.325
If I kick my high heels off

00:23:13.325 --> 00:23:15.794
And hold them in both hands

00:23:15.794 --> 00:23:20.866
I could even throw away my pride

00:23:21.033 --> 00:23:29.608
For the first time, I feel like
I might do something really unfair

00:23:30.809 --> 00:23:41.487
I just want to collapse on the street and cry

00:23:42.421 --> 00:23:46.926
Looking for you and fall in love

00:23:47.660 --> 00:23:51.864
Because I'm not really so strong

00:23:52.598 --> 00:23:56.669
If you kissed me right now

00:23:57.469 --> 00:24:02.107
I'd cry, what should I do?

00:24:02.408 --> 00:24:08.113
What should I do with this love?
